            "value": "<p>The symbiont is your armour and cannot be removed. It functions as <strong>explorer's clothing that is alive</strong>: AC item bonus +0, Dex cap +5, no check penalty, no Speed penalty, no Bulk. It accepts armour potency, resilient and property runes, etched by feeding rather than by a smith.</p><p><strong>You cannot wear other armour.</strong> Attempting it suppresses Living Plate, every Mutation, and your Instinct until you take it off.</p><p>This is also <strong>the Carapace</strong>: its Hardness, Hit Points and Broken Threshold are the plate's. Repair it with the Repair activity.</p>"
